+ *  what they meant.
+ *
+ *  A scan, not a regex: `/'((?:[^']|'')*)'/g` keeps a backtracking frame per
+ *  character of a literal and overflowed the stack on a ~15 MB one (an
+ *  RAWSTRING or a media row written as hex). The scan pairs quotes the way
